---
// LossDefinitionCircles.astro
---
<div class="my-14 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">What Exactly Is a "Loss"?</h3>
    <p class="text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 text-sm">Four lenses, four different answers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    
    <!-- Economic Loss -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 rounded-r-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-500 font-bold">1</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white text-lg">Economic Loss</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mb-4">
        "Has my total purchasing power declined?"
      </p>
      <div class="bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300 font-medium">
        Verdict: <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-500 font-bold ml-1">No Loss.</span> (₹10L before, ₹10L after).
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Accounting Loss -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 border-l-4 border-gold-500 rounded-r-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-gold-50 dark:bg-gold-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-600 dark:text-gold-500 font-bold">2</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white text-lg">Accounting Loss</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mb-4">
        "Did I sell a specific asset for less than its book value?"
      </p>
      <div class="bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300 font-medium">
        Verdict: <span class="text-red-500 font-bold ml-1">₹5L Loss.</span> (Bought at ₹100, Sold at ₹50).
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tax Loss (Pre-2022) -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-bold">3</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white text-lg">Tax Loss (Pre-2022)</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mb-4">
        "What does the Income Tax Act explicitly allow?"
      </p>
      <div class="bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300 font-medium">
        Verdict: <span class="text-red-500 font-bold ml-1">₹5L Loss.</span> (The loophole allowed accounting loss to be claimed).
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tax Loss (Post-2022) -->
    <div class="bg-navy-900 dark:bg-navy-900 border-l-4 border-navy-500 rounded-r-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-white">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-navy-800 flex items-center justify-center text-navy-300 font-bold">4</div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Tax Loss (Current)</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-300 mb-4">
        "What does Section 94(8) dictate today?"
      </p>
      <div class="bg-navy-800 px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm text-navy-200 font-medium">
        Verdict: <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">Loss Ignored.</span> (Forced to align with economic reality).
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
